===persian===

یک مرد،
یک سنگ،
و تنهٔ پیر یک درخت
و در زمینه،
مِهی غلیظ...
یک خطِ کوتاهِ آبی...
یک نقطهٔ کوچکِ سرخ.
ای کاش خاطره...
مثلِ ابر می‌بارید....
مثلِ خورشید می‌تابید...
و چون غبار...
گم نمی‌شد...
دههٔ ۱۳۷۰

===machine===

One man,
one stone,
and the old trunk of a tree
and in the background,
a thick mist...
one short blue line...
one small red dot.
If only memory...
rained down like the cloud....
blazed like the sun...
and did not, like dust...
get lost...
The 1370s

===lantern===

One man,
one stone,
the old trunk of a tree,
and in the background
a thick mist...
one short blue line...
one small red dot.
If only memory
rained down like the cloud....
blazed like the sun...
and did not get lost
the way dust does...

The 1370s

===translation===

===footnotes===

The opening is a picture being catalogued rather than a scene being witnessed — a man, a
stone, a tree, a ground, and then two marks named only by colour and size. The poem is looking at
its author's other work.
